# CODEOWNERS — This One Time On Acid
# GitHub will request reviews from these owners on PRs that modify files matching each pattern.
#
# See: https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners
# Governance: Decision GH-003 (CODEOWNERS & Branch Protection)

# Governance & Critical Infrastructure
# ====================================
# Critical governance, validation, and build systems require @ashley review
.github/                @ashley
scripts/                @ashley
AGENTS.md               @ashley
CHANGELOG.md            @ashley
.nvmrc                  @ashley
package.json            @ashley
package-lock.json       @ashley
vite.config.ts          @ashley

# Testing Infrastructure
# ======================
# Test configuration and test fixtures require review
jest.config.js          @ashley
vitest.config.ts        @ashley
playwright.config.ts    @ashley
tests/                  @ashley

# Documentation
# ==============
# Guidelines and core documentation require @ashley review
guidelines/             @ashley
docs/                   @ashley
README.md               @ashley

# Default Owner
# ==============
# For files not matched by specific patterns above, @ashley is the default owner
*                       @ashley
